| RR Type | _NODE NAME | Reference           |
|---------|------------|---------------------|
| TXT     | _domainkey | [RFC6376], RFC XXXX |


# Security Considerations

An "mldsa44" key of the wrong length is malformed (see p=);
accepting one would lose the strong unforgeability ML-DSA
provides (Section 3.6.2 of [FIPS-204]).

See also the Security Considerations of [RFC6376] and [DKIM2SPEC].

